{#- Live game state for the "mastery" strategy. Facts are computed by
    balatrollm.analysis (Jinja globals) so the model never does arithmetic. -#}
{%- set S = run_status(G, rounds, history) -%}
{%- set plan = main_hand_plan(G) -%}
{%- set boss = boss_impact(G, plan) -%}
{%- set I = shop_impact(G) if G.state in ["SHOP", "SMODS_BOOSTER_OPENED"] else none -%}
{%- macro card_line(c) -%}
{%- if c.state and c.state.hidden -%}face-down card
{%- else -%}{{ c | card_name }} ({{ c | card_chips }} chips)
{%- if c.modifier and c.modifier.enhancement %} {{ c.modifier.enhancement }}{% endif %}
{%- if c.modifier and c.modifier.edition %} {{ c.modifier.edition }}{% endif %}
{%- if c.modifier and c.modifier.seal %} {{ c.modifier.seal }}-seal{% endif %}
{%- if c.state and c.state.debuff %} DEBUFFED (scores 0){% endif %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro joker_line(j) -%}
{%- if j.state and j.state.hidden -%}face-down joker
{%- else -%}{{ j.label }} {{ joker_tag(j, S.tag_hand, S.ante) }}{% if j.modifier and j.modifier.edition %} ({{ j.modifier.edition }}){% endif %}
{%- if j.value and j.value.effect %} | effect: {{ j.value.effect }}{% endif %}
{%- if j.state and j.state.debuff %} | DEBUFFED{% endif %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
# STATUS
{%- if flags and flags.lessons %}{% for l in past_lessons(G, S.status, flags.lessons if flags.lessons is string else none) %}
- Past games: {{ l }}
{%- endfor %}{% endif %}
- Ante {{ S.ante }}/8, round {{ G.round_num }}, money ${{ S.money }}
- MAIN_HAND: {{ S.main_label }}{% if S.main_suit %} (MAIN_SUIT: {{ S.main_suit }}){% endif %} - {{ S.main_reason }}
- Jokers {{ S.jokers }}/{{ S.joker_limit }}, SLOTS_FREE {{ S.slots_free }}, XMULT_OWNED {{ S.xmult_owned }}
- FLOOR ${{ S.effective_floor }}, SPENDABLE ${{ S.spendable }} (interest next round ${{ S.interest }}){% if G.state == "SHOP" %} | SCORE_SPENDABLE ${{ S.score_spendable }}{% if S.score_spendable > S.spendable %}{% if S.reserve %} (keeps RESERVE ${{ S.reserve }}){% else %} (may go to $0){% endif %}{% else %} (same as SPENDABLE){% endif %} for a score buy: a joker with SCORE +50% or more, an on-plan [XMULT] joker (not [OFF-PLAN]), a [MAIN] Planet, a Buffoon pack with SLOTS_FREE > 0{% if S.status in ["THIN", "SHORT"] %}, or any joker with SCORE above +0 ({{ S.status }}){% endif %}{% if S.ante >= 4 %}. From Ante 4 one buy may take money below $10; after it the shop closes{% endif %}{% endif %}{% if S.shop_locked %}
- SHOP CLOSED: a buy took money below $10 (Ante 4+). You may still use or sell cards; then call next_round.{% endif %}
- ECON_OK {{ "YES" if S.econ_ok else "NO" }} (economy jokers owned {{ S.econ_owned }}) | BLUE_SEALS {{ S.blue_seals }}{% if not S.blue_seals %} (none yet: Standard packs and Blue Seal cards are wanted){% endif %}{% if S.hologram %} | HOLOGRAM owned (every card added helps){% endif %}
{% for t in S.pending_tags %}- PENDING TAG: {{ t }}
{% endfor %}- INTEREST_SPARE ${{ S.interest_spare }} (spend up to this and next round's interest stays ${{ S.interest }})
- STATUS: {{ S.status }} for the next blind ({{ S.next_name }}){% if S.win_pct is not none %}, win chance about {{ S.win_pct }}%{% endif %}{% if S.hands_needed %}: {{ S.sit_target | fmt_num }} needs about {{ S.hands_needed }} of {{ S.next_hands }} hands at about {{ S.sit_per | fmt_num }} per hand (your best plays: {{ S.best_types | join(", ") }}){% endif %}{% if S.safety_net %}; your last 2 blinds were each won with 2+ hands left{% endif %}{% if S.status in ["THIN", "SHORT"] %} -> score buys may use SCORE_SPENDABLE{% endif %}
{%- if S.last_spare is not none and G.state != "SELECTING_HAND" %}
- LAST BLIND: won with {{ S.last_spare }} hand{{ "s" if S.last_spare != 1 }} spare (a signal; STATUS is the test)
{%- endif %}
{%- set bc = S.boss_check %}
{%- if bc and (not bc.ok or bc.name == "The Needle") %}
- BOSS CHECK: {{ bc.name }} ({{ bc.target | fmt_num }}{% if bc.allowed == 1 %}, ONE hand only{% endif %}): about {{ bc.per_hand | fmt_num }} per hand{% if bc.grown_blinds %} once your growing jokers grow over the {{ bc.grown_blinds }} blind{{ "s" if bc.grown_blinds != 1 }} before it{% endif %} -> {% if bc.ok %}beatable in {{ bc.hands }} of {{ bc.allowed }} hand{{ "s" if bc.allowed != 1 }}{% else %}BOSS NEEDS about +{{ bc.needs | fmt_num }} per hand{% if bc.allowed == 1 %} in ONE play: raise one play (MAIN_HAND planet, xMult){% endif %}. A joker or MAIN planet that closes this, a counter for {{ bc.name }}, or Director's Cut counts as a score buy{% endif %}
{%- elif bc %}
- BOSS CHECK: {{ bc.name }}: beatable with your current build (about {{ bc.hands }} of {{ bc.allowed }} hands)
{%- endif %}
{%- if S.boss_reroll_request %}
- BOSS REROLL queued: {{ S.boss_reroll_request.boss }} is rerolled at the next blind select ($10 then)
{%- elif S.boss_reroll_ok %}
- BOSS REROLL available ($10{% if S.ante >= 4 %}, $10 stays after it{% endif %}, one per ante): call reroll_boss and {{ boss.name }} is rerolled at the next blind select{% if boss.name == "The Plant" %}. The Plant turns off your face-card jokers: you may ask for a boss reroll{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
- GOALS for Ante {{ S.ante }}: {% for g in S.goals %}[{{ "x" if g.done else " " }}] {{ g.text }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
- PRIORITY: {{ S.priority }}.
{%- if S.invest %}
- BUY vs SAVE vs REROLL: {{ S.invest.line }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if S.observatory %}
- Observatory owned: HOLD MAIN_HAND planets instead of using them.
{%- endif %}
{%- if boss.name %}
{%- if G.state == "SELECTING_HAND" and ((G.blinds or {}).boss or {}).status != "CURRENT" %}
- Boss this ante (a LATER blind, NOT this one: its rules do not apply now): {{ boss.name }} ({{ boss.score | fmt_num }}): {{ boss.effect }}
{%- else %}
- Boss this ante: {{ boss.name }} ({{ boss.score | fmt_num }}): {{ boss.effect }}{% if boss.counter %}. Counter: {{ boss.counter }}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if boss.impact and not (G.state == "SELECTING_HAND" and ((G.blinds or {}).boss or {}).status != "CURRENT") %}
- Boss impact: {{ boss.impact }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if boss.prep and G.state in ["SHOP", "SMODS_BOOSTER_OPENED"] %}
- Boss prep (plan this shop for it): {{ boss.prep }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if G.state in ["SHOP", "SMODS_BOOSTER_OPENED"] and boss.name == "Verdant Leaf" and ((G.blinds or {}).boss or {}).status in ["SELECT", "UPCOMING"] %}
- Joker sales before the Verdant Leaf blind do not count; only a joker sold during that blind turns it off.
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
{% if G.state == "SELECTING_HAND" %}
{%- set A = play_advice(G, dig=true) if flags and flags.dig_line else play_advice(G) -%}
{%- set P = A.progress %}
# ROUND
- Blind: {{ P.name }}, target {{ P.target | fmt_num }}, scored {{ P.scored | fmt_num }}
- NEED {{ P.remaining | fmt_num }} more | HANDS {{ P.hands_left }} | DISCARDS {{ P.discards_left }} | PER_HAND {{ P.per_hand | fmt_num }}
{%- if P.kind == "boss" and boss.disabled %}
- {{ boss.effect }}
{%- elif P.kind == "boss" and boss.counter %}
- Boss rule now: {{ boss.counter }}
{%- endif %}
{%- set V = verdant_options(G) %}
{%- if V %}
{%- if V.hidden %}
- Verdant Leaf sale comparison not shown: {{ V.hidden }}
{%- else %}
- keep all jokers: cards debuffed, best play {{ V.keep.names }} = {{ V.keep.score | fmt_num }} (floor)
{%- for s in V.sells %}
- sell {{ s.joker }}: best play {{ s.names }} = {{ s.score | fmt_num }} (floor)
{%- endfor %}
{%- if V.not_shown %}
- ({{ V.not_shown }} more joker{{ "s" if V.not_shown != 1 }} not shown)
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
- Selling is optional; you may win on jokers alone.
{%- endif %}
{%- if P.kind == "boss" and "j_luchador" in S.owned_keys and not boss.disabled %}
{%- set lu = namespace(i=none) %}{% for j in G.jokers.cards %}{% if lu.i is none and j.key == "j_luchador" and not (j.state and j.state.debuff) %}{% set lu.i = loop.index0 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
- Luchador owned (joker {{ lu.i }}): selling it now disables {{ boss.name or "the boss" }} for this blind. If the boss hurts you, sell it (sell joker {{ lu.i }}) before you play.
{%- endif %}
{%- for sp in A.suit_pays %}
- {{ sp.label }}: {{ {"H": "Hearts", "D": "Diamonds", "C": "Clubs", "S": "Spades"}[sp.suit] }}{% if sp.label == "Ancient Joker" %} this round{% endif %}, {{ sp.gain }} per {{ {"H": "Heart", "D": "Diamond", "C": "Club", "S": "Spade"}[sp.suit] }} scored: keep those cards; a Flush in that suit scores most
{%- endfor %}
{%- if A.mail_rank %}
- Mail-In Rebate: discard {{ A.mail_rank }}s for $5 each this round (unless they are part of your play)
{%- endif %}
{%- if A.repeats %}
- {{ A.repeats }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if A.acrobat %}
- Acrobat: X3 on the LAST hand of the blind only{% if P.hands_left == 1 %} (this hand: listed scores include it){% else %}: keep a strong play for your last hand{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if A.discard_costs %}
- Discard costs: {{ A.discard_costs | join("; ") }}. Dig only when the gain is worth it.
{%- endif %}
{%- if A.blind_play %}
- The House: every card is face down. Playing {{ A.blind_play.n }} face-down card{% if A.blind_play.n > 1 %}s{% endif %} blind (they still score) typically scores about {{ A.blind_play.typical | fmt_num }}; or discard face-down cards to see new ones (each discard is gone for later hands). Your choice.
{%- endif %}
{%- if A.blue_in_hand %}
- Blue Seal card in hand at {{ A.blue_in_hand }}: keep it in hand (do not discard it), unless it is part of your best play: then play it (a Blue Seal only pays if the blind is won). When the blind is beaten it makes the Planet of your last played hand{% if S.consumable_slots_free %}.{% else %}, but your consumable slots are FULL: use or sell a consumable first.{% endif %}
{%- endif %}

## Your hand (index: card)
{% for c in G.hand.cards -%}
- {{ loop.index0 }}: {{ card_line(c) }}
{% endfor %}
## Listed plays (best per hand type, FLOOR score estimates)
{% for p in A.plays -%}
- {{ p.hand }} {{ p.cards }} = {% for i in p.cards %}{{ G.hand.cards[i] | card_name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %} -> {% if p.floor is defined and p.floor < p.score %}about {{ p.score | fmt_num }}, at worst {{ p.floor | fmt_num }}{% else %}{{ p.score | fmt_num }}{% endif %}
{%- if p.blocked %} BLOCKED: {{ p.blocked }}
{%- elif p.wins %} WINS
{%- elif p.reaches_pace %} (reaches PER_HAND)
{%- else %} (below PER_HAND){% endif %}
{%- if p.repeat %} [REPEAT: Card Sharp X3]{% endif %}
{%- if p.padded %} ({{ p.padded }}){% endif %}
{%- if p.unknown %} (not counted: {{ p.unknown | join(", ") }}){% endif %}
{% else -%}
- none
{% endfor %}
{%- if A.mark_play %}{% set mp = A.mark_play -%}
- Face-down play {{ mp.cards }} = {{ mp.n }} face-down card{{ "s" if mp.n != 1 }} (The Mark: {% if mp.any_rank %}with Pareidolia any card can come face down; it{% else %}each is a J, Q or K and{% endif %} still scores) -> about {{ mp.expected | fmt_num }}, {% if mp.floor is not none %}at worst {{ mp.floor | fmt_num }}{% else %}lowest of 300 tries {{ mp.low | fmt_num }}{% endif %}; {% if mp.minimum %}at least {{ mp.minimum }}{% else %}no sure hand{% endif %}, most often {{ mp.likely }}
{%- if mp.wins %} WINS{% elif mp.reaches_pace %} (reaches PER_HAND){% else %} (below PER_HAND){% endif %}
{% endif %}
{%- if A.draws %}
## Draws worth chasing (chance to complete with one discard)
{% for d in A.draws -%}
- {{ d.text }}: discard {{ d.discard }} -> {{ d.chance | pct }}{% if d.if_complete %}, if it hits scores {{ d.if_complete | fmt_num }}{% endif %}{% if d.one_shot %} (wins the blind in one hand){% endif %}{% if d.chase %} = CHASE ({{ d.within | pct }} to hit with your discards){% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{%- endif %}{%- if A.dig_line %}
- Dig or play: play now: {{ A.dig_line.x_pct }}% to beat the blind / dig (discard {% for i in A.dig_line.dig.discard %}{{ G.hand.cards[i] | card_name }}{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}{% endfor %}): {{ A.dig_line.y_pct }}%
{%- endif %}
- Suggested discard: {% if A.discard %}{{ A.discard }} = {% for i in A.discard %}{{ G.hand.cards[i] | card_name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% else %}none: play instead{% endif %}
{%- if flags and flags.suggest_action %}
- Suggested action: {% if A.action.tool == "use" %}use consumable {{ A.action.consumable }} with cards {{ A.action.cards }}{% else %}{{ A.action.tool }} {{ A.action.cards }}{% endif %} ({{ A.action.why }})
{%- endif %}
- Suits in hand: {% for s, n in A.hand_suits.items() %}{{ s }} {{ n }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %} | {% if A.mark_unseen %}Unseen cards (deck + your face-down cards) {{ A.deck_size }}{% else %}Deck left {{ A.deck_size }}{% endif %}: {% for s, n in A.deck_suits.items() %}{{ s }} {{ n }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{%- if G.state == "SHOP" %}
# SHOP
{%- set FT = first_shop_tight(G) %}
{%- if FT %}
- FIRST SHOP, TIGHT MONEY: ${{ FT.money }} cannot cover the {{ FT.pack }} (${{ FT.pack_cost }}) and {{ FT.jokers | join(" / ") }}. Your call: the pack offers a choice of jokers; each shop joker shows its SCORE now (and in 3 rounds when it grows); the next blind is {{ S.status }}. About +50% or more is often worth buying before the pack; if the next blind is COMFORTABLE you may buy neither and keep the money.
{%- endif %}
{%- if I and I.score %}
- TYPICAL: your best play scores about {{ I.score | fmt_num }} per hand now ({{ I.plays }} hands dealt from your deck, mostly {{ I.mix | join(", ") }}).{% set nb0 = next_blind(G) %}{% if nb0 and nb0.score %} Next blind {{ nb0.score | fmt_num }} = about {{ ((nb0.score + I.score - 1) // I.score) | int }} such hands.{% endif %}
- SCORE = change per hand if you buy the item (growing jokers show now and in 3 rounds).{% if not S.slots_free %} Slots are full: each shop joker also shows its best swap.{% endif %}{% if I.chips_sources %} CHIPS sources owned: {{ I.chips_sources }} (one is usually enough: a second [CHIPS] joker adds little; prefer Mult/xMult).{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
